    spokenAudioFeedbackVi: 'T\xF4i \u0111\xE3 nghe c\xE2u l\u1EC7nh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi k\u1ECBch b\u1EA3n \u0111i\u1EC1u h\xE0nh. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 n\xF3i: "B\xE1o c\xE1o doanh thu", "Giao ban s\xE1ng", ho\u1EB7c "Duy\u1EC7t c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c".',
